{
  "note": "Stubbed tool set for spike S-AI-00 (ADR-128 section 5). Every schema stays inside the portable subset (ADR 4.4 rule 1): objects, strings, numbers, integers, booleans, enums, arrays and nullable fields, every field required, no unions or references. All data is fictional. A result entry matches when every field in `when` is a case-insensitive substring of the call's input; the first match wins and an entry without `when` is the default. Text like {{locality|Chennai}} is filled from the call's input.",
